      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): return delivered=false for pending completion announces",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nWhen the completion-agent handoff is still pending, `sendSubagentAnnounceDirectly` returned `delivered: true`, silently dropping the completion notification across all spawn depths and leaving the parent session waiting forever. (#93323)\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nA pending gateway response means the handoff has not completed yet. Returning `delivered: false` lets the dispatch fall through to the steering fallback via the active-requester queue wake path.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- New test covers the `completion_handoff_pending` dispatch fallback\n- All existing agent announcement dispatch tests pass",
